  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "雞快樂，tsiah ē生好卵"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><b>作者：陳睿穎</b></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhVNVlvYV8ZoxoX3CAZ-1ADL4aiD9jBae8ZKkxhzVUHSf-iqeVlN6h1pC2poQ-fNIqSIfSQ_TN0pJ9YwqiLt1zBeqtkGH1DzdtrHe6zLBHoA50C0pB89D0vIRdX2g5FF0UfYm6OjQOhe0Sc/s1600/L1480737.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1067\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"425\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhVNVlvYV8ZoxoX3CAZ-1ADL4aiD9jBae8ZKkxhzVUHSf-iqeVlN6h1pC2poQ-fNIqSIfSQ_TN0pJ9YwqiLt1zBeqtkGH1DzdtrHe6zLBHoA50C0pB89D0vIRdX2g5FF0UfYm6OjQOhe0Sc/s640/L1480737.JPG\" width=\"640\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\">「你kám有想--過，你beh按怎死？」今仔日ê講師陳玉敏，一開場就問tsit个問題，beh hōo逐家斟酌想看māi。伊做動物保護工作已經25年，人、動物kap疾病中間ê關係，已經看透透。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\">人類歷史發展到tann，「食」早就tsiânn做一種工業。規千規萬ê性命出世，就是為著出奶、生卵、刣肉hōo lán食，但是in在生ê時tsūn，受著啥mih款ê對待，食肉ê人kám知影？凡勢m̄是所有ê人lóng ē同情tsia-ê經濟動物，但是in過了有好--無，確實ē影響著肉質kap其他產品。甚至in所蹛ê環境好bái，也牽連著lán上頭疼ê「人畜共通」傳染病。若無想beh無代無誌食kah破病、無愛受著新型傳染病威脅，lán tio̍h-ài發揮消費者ê力量，hōo動物過了khah sù-sī。Tse一切，ē-tàng先uì買雞卵開始。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgeBvTUtTeEsMhQoMrAK5uINkk9Nbp7-1eCg4KUo0dDz8FLchZ-U39vQpaRSzH_g8GbDim69shL3fGzxSBjv4RK5S-2y4T0tlB8VHJNMewnxumFmI0eXgW8dmztw6gGl_ffoGE9AU3UwFw8/s1600/L1480710.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1067\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"426\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgeBvTUtTeEsMhQoMrAK5uINkk9Nbp7-1eCg4KUo0dDz8FLchZ-U39vQpaRSzH_g8GbDim69shL3fGzxSBjv4RK5S-2y4T0tlB8VHJNMewnxumFmI0eXgW8dmztw6gGl_ffoGE9AU3UwFw8/s640/L1480710.JPG\" width=\"640\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\">陳老師講：「雞仔快樂，tsiah ē生好卵。」台灣人一年食77億粒ê雞卵，但是真少人知影，tsia-ê生卵雞，百分之90 lóng關tī籠仔底，無hōo in照天性食睏。雞tiâu siunn lah-sap，雞母gâu破病，suah用抗生素透水hōo雞食，lán食雞、食卵，mā kā tsia-ê毒藥吞落腹肚。其實雞仔生成愛洗身軀、ài揣安全ê siū tsiah生卵、ài踮kuân ê所在tsiah睏ē落眠，只要hōo in thang照家己ê習慣來生活，雞母健康，雞卵自然營養100分！Lán買卵ê時tsūn，tio̍h-ài揀盒仔頂註明雞母是「放飼」、「平飼」ê產品，食健康、食功德，uì lán家己做起。&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhFRhsU66wyhzJbbovNbK27UCJJZ4S5ut7U1ZBdVCkhcltpL7ChsSLFd5MsKA0T8zyJqs8Jx_xzTIKP4BUTAR5TuWSIMkyeSn2bwvtXJpc8RTKOinEz2Fjx5bljPOK1PFv4wd8wnaNLp28R/s1600/L1480754.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1067\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"426\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhFRhsU66wyhzJbbovNbK27UCJJZ4S5ut7U1ZBdVCkhcltpL7ChsSLFd5MsKA0T8zyJqs8Jx_xzTIKP4BUTAR5TuWSIMkyeSn2bwvtXJpc8RTKOinEz2Fjx5bljPOK1PFv4wd8wnaNLp28R/s640/L1480754.JPG\" width=\"640\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: x-small;\">編按：本文是2020/2/20棲地復育台語講座－「伊快活 你才會歡喜」─ 農場動物福利和飲食安全佮永續講座摘要記錄，講者陳玉敏是台灣動物社會研究會ê副執行長。台灣蠻野心足生態協會舉辦ê「蠻野講堂」tuì 2019年3月份起kap李江却台語文教基金會合辦規劃十場有關生態環境議題ê台語講座，歡迎逐家tī逐個月第三禮拜五暗時7點到9點，同齊來「呷米共食廚房」（台北市中正區衡陽路9號3樓）擴展家己ê台語棲地（tshe-tē）！詳細資料ē-tàng看「台灣蠻野心足生態協會」FB專頁。</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span>\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span>\n<div style=\"background-color: white;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>#</b></span></span><span style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>棲地復育台語講座專欄，</b></span><span style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案</b></span><b style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;\">。</b></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報313期，2020年4月出刊。</b></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px;\">\n--------------------------------------------</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFK